{\Large\color{CoverGoldBright} $if(backcover-symbol)$$backcover-symbol$$else${\greekfont λόγος}$endif$}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "The Word"} · 道——貫穿全書的那個字}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
這本書寫給剛開始讀聖經的人：不教你學完整的希臘文，而是教你怎麼讀得懂、再用得對。從二十四個字母、文法速查，到查字的正確姿勢與常見的「原文說」謬誤；用約翰福音 1:1-5 做一次完整的逐字讀；並附上以真實計數為據的常用字表、各卷核心字的用法、新約二十七卷讀經地圖、練習與答案，幾首可以唱的歌；卷二更把本系列二十四卷研讀表格裏查過的希臘字，按書卷與跨卷整理（歌羅西書與提摩太前後書沒有可讀的表格），並標明每一條核對到哪一級。

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}A}{}\ first guide for new Bible students\ \textemdash\ not a Greek course, but a way to read first and verify second: the alphabet, a grammar quick-reference, how to look up a word without being misled, a full word-by-word reading of John 1:1\textendash{}5, and every count computed from the SBLGNT corpus; Part Two lists, book by book, the Greek words in the word-study tables of twenty-four of the series' New Testament books, each marked by what could be verified.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 讀完之後，你能做七件事}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Seven Things You Will Be Able to Do}

