看懂形態與文法標注 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Read parsing and grammar} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 4 章}\\[0.25em]
不被「原文說」誤導 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Spot word-study fallacies} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 5 章}\\[0.25em]
看出動詞的「樣子」 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} See the shape of a verb} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 6 章}\\[0.25em]
逐字讀約翰福音 1:1-5 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Read John 1:1\textendash{}5 word by word} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 7 章}\\[0.25em]
先認最該認的字 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Learn the right words first} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 8 章}\\[0.25em]
用歌記住 & \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Sing to remember} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 第 11 章}\\
